1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,460
All power. We welcome all people of the world to witness the first meeting of the Intercommunal Council of the Revolution, also known as the People's Council, or just the Council.

2
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:29,400
This is a formal public forum attributed and guided by the first people of the Turtle Island with representatives from various liberation and revolutionary groups, with the Black Panther Party as the host who completely and comprehensively reject the incumbent one world order currently controlled by the transnational capitalist class,

3
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:41,340
which upholds the destructive and predatory mechanism of the U.S. uniparty, Democrat and Republican, fascism, capitalism, racism, imperialism, nationalism, colonialism, and liberalism.

4
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:59,020
This body of representatives will serve as the interim temporary mechanism of the official deliberation for the people of the current class wartime until a full revolution from the current tyrannical system of capital is accomplished in a more suitable, decentralized representation of the people as established.

5
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:15,740
This body of intercommunal guardians of the people will also set the example and model for decentralized local, province, state, city, town, neighborhood councils of similar structure and representations to foster a cohesive momentum towards united sovereignty

6
00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:34,920
In preparation for a full revolution from the incumbent one world order and to facilitate full freedom from the current enslaved world, the Council and all associated local formations of this Council will center the Four Winds Plan for United Sovereignty as a starting point of common strategy, deliberation, and coordination.

7
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:51,560
Each party represented to the Council will encourage their members to follow suit and conclusion within formal sessions and give viewers tangible tools and strategies to accomplish a hard revolution and bridge groups and cooperation for that goal while maintaining their own unique systems approach and sovereignty.

8
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:59,020
Sitting in solidarity before you and the intercommunal council are the following representatives and their representative party and our demographics.

9
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:04,640
The Black Panther Party represented by National Minister of Defense Bunchy Carter of the Tacoma Chapter.

10
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:10,880
The Panther Party formerly known as the White Panther Party represented by Central Committee Member Doc Molotov.

11
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:15,740
The Brown Beret represented by Capitana Esty of Southern California.

12
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:19,640
The Movement to Liberate Palestine represented by Mohams.

13
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:23,280
The American Indian Movement represented by myself.

14
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:27,080
The Rednecks Patriots and Veterans represented by Panther Party.

15
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,180
Member Mark Wayne.

16
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:35,480
The Panther's stance on indigenous sovereignty within colonialized land is unwavering in both ideology and practice.

17
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:45,120
Consequently, it is recognized by all represented parties that the intercommunal council is represented within Turtle Island and must be attributed by First Nations authority.

18
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:54,340
Therefore, the 10,000-plus-year-old position of the firekeeper will be revived in honor of the ancient traditions of deliberations within the Air Corps Confederacy.

19
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:59,880
Every session within the council will be open, closed, and attributed by the wisdom and direction of the firekeeper.

20
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:10,620
All officially recognized council, local and regional, operating under the model of the intercommunal council, must have a firekeeper, and all firekeepers must be from First Nations of Turtle Island.

21
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:22,700
This will maintain the safeguard that all deliberations for the revolution within Turtle Island will be represented and prioritize the sovereignty of First People of Turtle Island, and that no decisions concerning her future are made outside of her.

22
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:42,580
Honored to Fred Hampton, as host party of the intercommunal council, the Black Panther Party will always work to ensure that Fred Hampton's spirit of care and inclusion is observed by empowering the comrade parties and offering initial strategies of survival to be analyzed, adopted, or negotiated within its comrade parties.

23
00:03:42,580 --> 00:03:55,060
First of all, I would like to state on behalf of the Black Panther Party, how much every person who is here is appreciated.

24
00:03:55,060 --> 00:04:03,740
This is not for the weak of mind, of spirit, of physicality, of any kind.

25
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:06,440
So the fact that you're here says a lot.

26
00:04:07,060 --> 00:04:14,280
There is a war that has been raging for quite some time, and it's intensifying right before our eyes.

27
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:19,880
The most important thing we can do now is find ways to unite instead of finding ways to stay divided.

28
