We are not going to be in a position to make decisions for every person or every group of people.

35
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:14,900
These people have our greatest duty is actually to educate the people to the point where they make these decisions for themselves.

36
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:19,160
If they have a full understanding of exactly what it is they're facing, exactly what it is they're fighting,

37
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:24,180
exactly what it is they should be doing in order to bridge the gap and to close the doors

38
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:27,300
